---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Wordmark from '../components/Wordmark.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Stept"
  description="How Stept handles your data: what we collect, where it lives, and your rights."
>
  <header class="nav">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="/" aria-label="Stept home"><Wordmark /></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/">← Back</a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Stept ("we") provides an open-source customer-support platform, available self-hosted and
      as a hosted service at <a href="https://app.stepped.ai">app.stepped.ai</a> ("Stept Cloud").
      Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@stepped.ai">hello@stepped.ai</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Self-hosted installs</h2>
    <p>
      If you self-host Stept, we collect nothing. All data stays in your own infrastructure and
      your own database. The software makes no calls home — the only outbound requests are the
      ones you configure (your AI provider, your email transport, your integrations).
    </p>

    <h2>Stept Cloud — what we store</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account data:</strong> your email address, name and password hash.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Workspace content:</strong> conversations, contacts, knowledge documents,
        articles, tours and settings your team creates — processed solely to provide the
        service to you.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Provider credentials:</strong> AI model keys and channel tokens you connect are
        encrypted at rest.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Technical logs:</strong> IP addresses and request metadata, kept short-term for
        security and rate limiting.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where it lives</h2>
    <p>
      Stept Cloud runs on EU infrastructure (Hetzner). Traffic is served through Cloudflare for
      TLS and DDoS protection.
    </p>

    <h2>AI processing</h2>
    <p>
      When your workspace uses an AI feature, the relevant conversation and knowledge excerpts
      are sent to the model provider <em>you</em> configured with <em>your</em> key. We do not
      train models on your data and we add no hidden providers.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can export or delete your workspace data at any time — email
      <a href="mailto:hello@stepped.ai">hello@stepped.ai</a> for GDPR requests (access,
      rectification, erasure, portability).
    </p>

    <h2>Sub-processors</h2>
    <p>Hetzner Online GmbH (hosting, EU) · Cloudflare, Inc. (network/TLS) · the AI and email
      providers you explicitly connect.</p>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-base">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Stept</span>
      <a href="/">stepped.ai</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  .nav {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 4rem;
  }
  .legal {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .muted {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
  }
  .footer-base {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
